<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Once all rooms are secured, the team performs a final safety inspection.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The cargo is loaded onto a climate‑controlled truck, with weight distribution calculated to prevent shifting.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>The driver’s route is pre‑planned to avoid narrow roads and steep inclines typical of Shillong’s terrain.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Throughout transit, the driver maintains a log of temperature, humidity, and any incidents.</span></li></ul>

<p>Arrival at the destination triggers the uncrating process. The crew first checks the arrival checklist against the packing list, then unloads rooms in the same sequence they were packed. Items are placed in their designated areas, and fragile goods are inspected for damage.</p>
<p>The team sets up essential utilities—plumbing, electricity, and internet—before handing over the keys. A final walkthrough with the client confirms satisfaction, completing the cycle of a professional move in Shillong.</p></div>
